{"id":"e2be868cf664b716","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-abelian.md","title":"Abelian Algebra","display":"df-abelian — Abelian Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-abelian","aliases":["93-df-abelian"],"display":"df-abelian — Abelian Algebra","depends_on":["[[93-df-commutator]]","[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-congruence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-abelian"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-abelian</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-abelian — Abelian Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"18ca772ab524a46f\" href=\"?note=18ca772ab524a46f\" title=\"93-df-commutator\">93-df-commutator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\">\\(\\mathbf A\\)</span> is an algebra candidate, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\Delta_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span> are the diagonal and total congruences whenever it is an algebra.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> is the algebra predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[-,-]\">\\([-,-]\\)</span> is the congruence commutator of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"18ca772ab524a46f\" href=\"?note=18ca772ab524a46f\" title=\"93-df-commutator\">93-df-commutator</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbAlg}\">\\(\\mathrm{AbAlg}\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abelian}\\vdash\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{AbAlg}\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathbf A)\\land[\\nabla_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}]_{\\mathbf A}=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abelian}\\vdash\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{AbAlg}\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathbf A)\\land[\\nabla_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}]_{\\mathbf A}=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>By monotonicity of the commutator, the displayed top-congruence condition is equivalent to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\theta,\\psi]=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\">\\([\\theta,\\psi]=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> for all <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\theta,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-commutator","status":"resolved","id":"18ca772ab524a46f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-commutator]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$ is the algebra predicate of [[93-df-algebra]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-commutator","status":"resolved","id":"18ca772ab524a46f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$[-,-]$ is the congruence commutator of [[93-df-commutator]], and $\\mathrm{AbAlg}$ is defined here.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"[-,-]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbAlg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abelian}\\vdash\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{AbAlg}\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathbf A)\\land[\\nabla_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}]_{\\mathbf A}=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"[\\theta,\\psi]=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)","display":false}],"bytes":1098,"backlinks":[{"id":"e781e7ea72930406","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AbAlg}$ is the type-recovering class defined in [[93-df-abelian]]."},{"id":"fd49e6f1efcceae4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AbAlg}$ is the abelian-algebra class of [[93-df-abelian]]."},{"id":"a6c20c97a5eba13a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AbAlg}$ is the abelian-algebra class of [[93-df-abelian]]."},{"id":"1291a10d1576d0d7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"For Boolean algebras the congruence commutator is intersection.  The two\ndisplayed equalities are therefore the top and bottom instances; they do\nnot make a nontrivial Boolean algebra abelian in the sense of [[93-df-abelian]]."},{"id":"93417629b5b8941f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"86be4df10dc371c0","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AbAlg}$ is the class from [[93-df-abelian]], and $[-,-]_{\\mathbf A}$ is the commutator from [[93-df-commutator]]."}],"outgoing":["18ca772ab524a46f","6730349967b8ffce","30b341bfbd8b5301"]}